    <defName>LR_Visigoths</defName>
    <label>Visigoths</label>
    <description>The western Goths, who crossed the Danube in 376 fleeing the Huns, destroyed a Roman army and its emperor at Adrianople, and sacked Rome itself under Alaric in 410. Sometimes Rome's enemies and sometimes its allies, they are now carving out a kingdom of their own. Their strength is their cavalry: mailed nobles and lancers who ride down infantry, backed by spearmen behind tall shields. They follow the Arian faith that Ulfilas taught them, and they have no love for the Vandals.</description>
    <pawnSingular>Goth</pawnSingular>
    <pawnsPlural>Goths</pawnsPlural>
    <listOrderPriority>28</listOrderPriority>
    <settlementGenerationWeight>1</settlementGenerationWeight>
    <requiredCountAtGameStart>0</requiredCountAtGameStart>
    <maxConfigurableAtWorldCreation>9999</maxConfigurableAtWorldCreation>
    <startingCountAtWorldCreation>1</startingCountAtWorldCreation>
